{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26640","headline":"寄李羣玉 · 姚合","name":"寄李羣玉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九衢名与利，无计扰闲人。\n道远期轻世，才高贵重身。\n石脂稀胜乳，玉粉细於尘。\n骨换肌肤腻，心灵气色真。\n嵩山高到日，洛水煖如春。\n居住应安稳，黄金几竈新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}